# Trivy CVE suppression file (SC-7)
# Format: one CVE ID per line, with mandatory comment explaining the suppression
# and an expiry date. Never suppress without evidence and a named approver.
#
# Example:
# CVE-2024-XXXXX  # Accepted: affects feature X not used in this image. Expires: 2026-07-01. Approver: Jim.
#
# No active suppressions.
